{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52726","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 一 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斗，六星其状似北斗。\n魁上建星三相对，天弁建上三三九。\n斗下圆安十四星，虽然名鼈贯索形。\n天鸡建背双黑星，天龠柄前八黄精，狗国四方鸡下生。\n天渊十星鼈东边，更有两狗斗魁前，农家丈人狗下眠，天渊十黄狗色玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}